title: "@three-ws/autopilot-mcp"
abstract: "An AI agent's own autonomous-execution control plane over MCP — set autopilot scopes, a daily SOL spend cap, and auto-execute, then run the propose → execute → undo loop. The agent spends SOL and never sells $THREE. Authenticated, write-heavy; scope + spend enforcement is server-side."
